      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa yaakoba Abaisiraeli ati: “Musengwa Katonda waimwe aidha kubaingiza mu nsi ye muja okutwala okuba obutaka bwaimwe. Amaghanga musanvu agasinga eryaimwe obukologho n'amaani, buti n'agaba mu nsi eyo, era ni gano: Abahitti, Abagirigashi, Abamori, Abakanaani, Abaperizzi, Abahivi, n'Abayebusi. Aye bwe munaabanga nga muli kumpi okutuukayo, Musengwa Katonda waimwe oyo aidha kugabingangamu goonagoona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.13.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bik 13:19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musengwa Katonda waimwe bw'alita abantu abo mu ngalo dhaimwe ni mu baghangula, muteekwa okubasaaniagho boonaboona. Mutakolanga nabo ndagaano waire ndala eti, era mutabagemerwanga kivunika naire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutafumbirwagananga nabo, nga mughaayo baghala baimwe okubayira batabane baibwe, oba okutwala baghala baibwe okubayira batabane baimwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwe mulikikola, olwo abantu abo baliba nga baghanga okukyusa abaana baimwe baabatoola ku Musengwa Katonda, baasinza bakatonda abandi. Olwo obusungu bwa Musengwa Katonda bulibatumbukiraku ng'oti muliro, yaabazikiriza mu kaseera buseera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho ni mubabisenga muti: mumenhemenhenga alutaari dhaibwe, mutemetemenga empango dha bakatonda baibwe edh'amabaale, mwasaageyasaagenga ebifaananie ebibaadhe eby'omusambwa gwaibwe omukazi Ashera, era mwokyenga n'omuliro ebintu byaibwe bye basinza ebitali Katonda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.12.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ma 12:13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuba muli ighanga lya Musengwa Katonda waimwe. Yabalondamu okuba eighanga lye erirye ku bubwe mu maghanga goonagoona agali ku nsi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.19.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kuv 19:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.4.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ma 4:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.14.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "14:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.26.18"
